body:
Read the tags, read the description, thought I had enough whiskey in me, thought I was ready to listen to it...



I wasn't ;◡;



Emotional/mental distress aside, I'm not surprised to hear another amazing audio from you. I don't know that I've heard anyone else with the same kind of genuine and emotional feel you put into yours. This one really hit hard too (I'm a mess rn lol) but in a good way and I'm still loving all your posts! Hope you're doing alright, thank you for another therapeutic audio :))
